OL,3,GNEWSARescued turtles released in
OL,4,Atearful farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers have waved an emotional
OL,7,Ffarewell to a rare turtle that was
OL,8,Fwashed up on Jersey.
OL,10,FThe loggerhead turtle, named Crush, was
OL,11,Fflown to the UK after being found
OL,12,Flifeless on a beach on 19 January
OL,13,Ffollowing Storm Goretti.
OL,15,FAfter six months recuperating at
OL,16,FWeymouth's Sea Life centre in Dorset,
OL,17,Fshe was released into the North
OL,18,FAtlantic off the Azores, along with two
OL,19,Fother loggerheads, Eden and Tiree, who
OL,20,Fwere rescued on the west coast of
OL,21,FScotland in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
