OL,3,GNEWSARescued turtles released in
OL,4,Atearful farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer carer, aquarist Victoria Goodier,
OL,7,Fsaid the release on Tuesday evening
OL,8,Fwent "perfectly", although there were
OL,9,F"definitely some tears" from people on
OL,10,Fthe boat.
